TEXT CHARACTER=214 TAXON=60 TEXT='The paroccipital processes of Trilophosaurus buettneri have a weak contact with the squamosal (Spiealmann et al. 2008: fig. 18) (MDE, 14 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=214 TAXON=99 TEXT='In Prolacerta broomi the paroccipital processes possess a weak contact with the posterior temporal region of the skull (BPI/1/471) (MDE, 14 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=214 TAXON=151 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-5867 (MDE, 14 September 2012).';
