TEXT CHARACTER=221 TAXON=73 TEXT='Cannot be determined bcause of the fusion between exoccipitals and basioccipital (MDE, 3 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=221 TAXON=88 TEXT='Based on Whatley (2005: 28) (MDE, 19 December 2015).';
