TEXT CHARACTER=222 TAXON=99 TEXT='Based on BP/1/5066 (MDE, 5 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=222 TAXON=135 TEXT='Although scored in the data matrix of Gower and Sennikov (1997: character 34), they say in the text that no trace of the hypoglosal foramina can be detected (2 April 2014).';
