TEXT CHARACTER=257 TAXON=151 TEXT='Based on Gower and Weber (1998: 379) (MDE, 31 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=258 TAXON=101 TEXT='The sphenethmoid described by Tatarinov (1978: 510) seems to have been too anterior to be a laterophenoid (MDE, 2 May 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=258 TAXON=204 TEXT='Based on the right side of MCZ 4117 (MDE, 22 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=258 TAXON=264 TEXT='Inferred from the well-preserved and defined facet on the ventral surface of the skull roof of ZPAL Ab IIII 1223 (MDE, April 20 2015).';
