TEXT CHARACTER=271 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on GHG K 106 (dorsally expanded) and SAM-PK-K8565 (mostly horizontal) (MDE, 9 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=272 TAXON=24 TEXT='In at least two specimens (NMK S 180 and the Simon and Bartholomaeus specimen) seem to be two posterior processes in the dentary (MDE; 31 March 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=272 TAXON=151 TEXT='The base of a posterodorsal process seems to be present in SAM-PK-5867 (MDE, 31 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=283 TAXON=53 TEXT='Flynn et al. (2010: 683) (MDE, 18 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=284 TAXON=60 TEXT='Scoring changed from that of PhD from (0) to (1) (MDE, 30 January 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=284 TAXON=204 TEXT='Based on MCZ 4116 (MDE 5 October 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=288 TAXON=60 TEXT='Based on Spielmann et al. (2008: fig. 27) (MDE, 16 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=288 TAXON=266 TEXT='Based on Sereno (2012: 107) (MDE, 27 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=289 TAXON=60 TEXT='Based on Pritchard et al. 2015 (MDE, 28 March 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=289 TAXON=169 TEXT='The posterior surangular foramen is present in MCZ 4037 but it seems to be absent in PULR 07 and PVL 4586 (MDE, 22 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=289 TAXON=188 TEXT='Based on NHMUK R38036, 42744 (MDE, 16 March 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=289 TAXON=266 TEXT='Based on Sereno (2012: 107) (MDE, 27 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=290 TAXON=15 TEXT='The postdentary bones of Planocephalosaurus are fused with each other (Fraser, 1982) and, as a result, it is not possible to determine the degree of exposition of the angular in lateral view (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=290 TAXON=60 TEXT='The exposition of the angular in lateral view is wide in TMM 31025-5 (Spielmann et al. 2008: fig. 28). Accordingly, the scoring was changed from (?) to (0) (MDE, 4 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=292 TAXON=1 TEXT='Based on Reisz (1981: 26) (MDE, 10 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=294 TAXON=104 TEXT='Based on RC 846 (MDE, 5 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=294 TAXON=136 TEXT='There is an area filled with matrix that may represent a medial foramen on the articular, but it cannot be determined confidently (MDE, 12 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=294 TAXON=141 TEXT='Based on Gower (2003: 35) (MDE, 26 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=294 TAXON=151 TEXT='Based on UMZC T6921 (MDE, 31 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=294 TAXON=204 TEXT='Based on MCZ 4116 (MDE 5 October 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=295 TAXON=99 TEXT='Based on BP/1/2675 (MDE, 23 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=295 TAXON=104 TEXT='e.g. BSPG 1934 VIII 514 (MDE, 23 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=295 TAXON=204 TEXT='Based on MCZ 4116 (MDE 5 October 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=298 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on comparisons between the maxillae and dentaries several specimens (MDE, 10 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=299 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Gow (1975) and pers. obs. of BP/1/3859 and GHG K 106 (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=299 TAXON=16 TEXT='Based on Evans (1980: 236) (MDE, 20 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=299 TAXON=24 TEXT='The height of the maxillary tooth crowns in labial and linguals views is subequal in the Simon Bartholomaeus specimen (SMNS 55387). This suggests that the tooth implantation is subthecodont (MDE, 15 February 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=299 TAXON=29 TEXT='The teeth are implanted into deep alveoli and not ankylosed to the tooth-bearing bone. The lingual margen of the alveoli seems to be lower than the labial margen, thus, the character is scores as subthecodont based on PIMUZ T2472, T4355 and T4822 (MDE, 30 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=299 TAXON=38 TEXT='Wild (1973) says that the kind of tooth implantation of Tanystrophaeus is subthecodont (page 48) (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=299 TAXON=99 TEXT='Modesto_&_Sues_2004._(DM)';
TEXT CHARACTER=299 TAXON=141 TEXT='It was added the fifth state. '' thecodont'' to that of the data matrix of Reisz et al. (2010) for Erythrosuchus africanus (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=303 TAXON=1 TEXT='Based on Reisz (1981: 27) (MDE, 10 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=303 TAXON=24 TEXT='Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009: 148) described the crowns of Protorosaurus as straight. However, in BSPG 1995 I 5 (cast of WMsN P47361) a few maxillary teeth are slightly distally curved. As a result, I scored this character as polymorphic in Protorosaurus (MDE, 3 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=303 TAXON=38 TEXT='Tanystropheus is strongly heterodont and the crowns possess a strong to slight distal curvature or completely lack it (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=303 TAXON=60 TEXT='This scoring was changed from (1) to (2) because Trilophosaurus buettneri lacks of a distal curvature in the margin teeth (Spielmann et al. 2008: figs. 18, 20, 21) (MDE, 4 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=303 TAXON=98 TEXT='Young (1973: fig. 1) illustrates a tooth crown with a convex mesial margin that it is not currently preserved in the specimen (MDE, April 7 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=305 TAXON=5 TEXT='Crowns are labiolingually compressed in GHG RS 160 and GHG K106, but not compressed in TM 1490 (MDE, 9 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=305 TAXON=15 TEXT='Based on Fraser (1982: 714, 719) (MDE, 3 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=305 TAXON=101 TEXT='Based on personal observation of the cast of the skull (MDE, April 7 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=307 TAXON=16 TEXT='Based on Evans (1980: 237) (MDE, 15 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=309 TAXON=5 TEXT='The hyoids were not recognized in the studied specimens and neither mentioned by Gow (1975) (MDE, 12 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=309 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on Nisotti (2007, fig. 12) (MDE, 2 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=309 TAXON=99 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-K10797 (MDE, 5 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=310 TAXON=24 TEXT='Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009: 153) said that the presence of a notochordal canal in the vertebrae of the Protorosaurus specimens cannot be assessed. However, in the cast MB R2173 (original probably destroyed during WWII) the surface of the posterior facet of the centrum is concave and clearly not notochordal (MDE, 24 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=310 TAXON=72 TEXT='Based on Carroll (1976: 42) (MDE, 18 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=311 TAXON=176 TEXT='ratio = 27.9 vs 29.2 = 0.95 (presacral 11, MDE 12 December 2022)';
