TEXT CHARACTER=315 TAXON=178 TEXT='Benton and Walker (2002: 33): "On the left-hand side, there is a low diagonally backwards-running ridge from the anteroventral margin of the centrum to the short transverse process, the parapophysis and diapophysis in continuum (MDE, 20 March 2017).';
TEXT CHARACTER=316 TAXON=29 TEXT='Although a centrodiapophyseal lamina seems to be present in PIMUZ T4822, the strongly compressed nature of the Macrocnemus specimens turns difficult to assess the condition of this character (MDE, 10 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=316 TAXON=99 TEXT='Based on BPI/1/2675 (MDE, 13 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=317 TAXON=29 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T4822 (10 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=317 TAXON=99 TEXT='Based on BP/1/2675 (MDE, 13 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=318 TAXON=99 TEXT='Based on BPI/1/2675 (MDE, 13 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=318 TAXON=104 TEXT='SAM-PK-11208 has a thick postzygodiapophyseal lamina but other specimens (e.g. SAM-PK-K140 lack this lamina) (MDE, 12 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=318 TAXON=151 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-6047B (MDE, 2 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=320 TAXON=99 TEXT='The posterior cervical and anterior dorsal vertebrae of BPI/1/2675 have mammillary processes on the lateral surface of the neural spines. Accordingly, the scoring of this character was changed from (0) to (1) (MDE, 14 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=320 TAXON=132 TEXT='Proterosuchids lack a transverse expansion of the neural spine posteriorly to the vertebrae with mammillary processes and, as a result, Koilamasuchus is scored with a question mark (MDE, 5 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=324 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Smith and Evans (1996) (MDE, 11 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=324 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-5882 and SAM-PK-6536 (MDE, 3 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=325 TAXON=1 TEXT='Based on Reisz (1981: 30) (MDE, 10 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=326 TAXON=134 TEXT='The atlantal intercentrum is preserved, based on unpublished photographs (MDE, 3 April 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=327 TAXON=49 TEXT='A keel is present on the axis of ZAR 07 (MDE, 2 May 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=327 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-5882 (MDE, 3 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=327 TAXON=141 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-3028 (MDE, 24 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=327 TAXON=203 TEXT='Based on Wu and Russell (2001: 44) (MDE, 22 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=330 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-6536 (MDE, 27 December 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=330 TAXON=107 TEXT='Based on a photograph in Cruickshank (1972), the neural spine of the axis is currently broken in NMQR 1484 (MDE, 11 May 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=330 TAXON=164 TEXT='The dorsal margin of the neural spine of the axis is damaged in PVL 4601 and PVL 4602 (MDE, 19 October 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=330 TAXON=169 TEXT='The dorsal margin of the neural spine of the axis is mostly straight in MCZ 4037 and dorsally convex in PVL 4575 (MDE, 19 October 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=330 TAXON=178 TEXT='Based on first-hand observation of NHMUK PV R3139 (MDE, 20 March 2017).';
TEXT CHARACTER=331 TAXON=15 TEXT='The exact position of the cervical vertebra illustrated by Fraser and Walkden (1984: fig. 5) is uncertain (MDE, 12 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=331 TAXON=16 TEXT='Ratio= 1.20 based on Evans (1981: fig. 4c) (MDE, 21 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=331 TAXON=25 TEXT='ratio = 2.47, it is probably Cv4 (MDE, 26 September 2024)';
TEXT CHARACTER=331 TAXON=29 TEXT='Ratio: 3.70-4.12 in PIMUZ T4822 (MDE, 22 December 2022).';
TEXT CHARACTER=331 TAXON=33 TEXT='The holotype and only known specimen seems to be a juvenile and there is evidence that cervicals become proportionally longer during ontogeny in tanystropheids. Thus, the ratio was scored as a minimum possible (MDE, 28 December 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=331 TAXON=38 TEXT='Ratio=14.25 in the fourth cervical of PIMUZ T2818 (MDE, 11 September 2012).';
