TEXT CHARACTER=337 TAXON=3 TEXT='The cervicals lack a depression or pit lateral to the base of the neural arch (MNHN 1908-32-57). Accordingly, the state of this character was changed from (1) to (0) (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=337 TAXON=24 TEXT='The seventh cervical of WMsN P47361 has a shallow excaviation next to the base of the neural spine, but the more anterior cervical vertebrae lack such depression (MDE, 3 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=337 TAXON=104 TEXT='The fifth to eight cervical vertebrae of Proterosuchus fergusi possess an excavation lateral to the neural spine, which is shallow in the middle cervicals and very deep in posterior cervicals, particularly in the eight cervical (BP/1/3993). These excavations are also present in Prolacerta broomi (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=338 TAXON=99 TEXT='A transpostzygapophyseal lamina is present in the third cervical, but not in the fourth and fifth cervicals (BP/1/2675) (MDE, 2 April 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=340 TAXON=29 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T4822 (MDE, 16 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=340 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T2818 (MDE, 11 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=341 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T2818 (MDE, 11 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=342 TAXON=25 TEXT='ratio = 0.88 (MDE, 14 September 2024)';
