TEXT CHARACTER=346 TAXON=29 TEXT='Intercentra are present in the cervical series of PIMUZ T4822, but absent in PIMUZ T2472 and T4355 (MDE, 11 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=346 TAXON=60 TEXT='Based on Spielmann et al. 2008 (fig. 30) (MDE, 13 September 2012).';
