TEXT CHARACTER=353 TAXON=3 TEXT='The condition of this character cannot be confidently determined in the holotype of Acerosodontosaurus (MNHN 1908-32-57). As a result, it is preferred here to score the character as (?) rather than (1) (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
