TEXT CHARACTER=370 TAXON=15 TEXT='Second sacral bifurcated, contrasting with the first one (Fraser Walkden, 1984) (MDE, 12 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=370 TAXON=60 TEXT='Trilophosaurus buettneri has two unequal sacral vertebrae (Spielmann et al. 2008) and, as a result, the scoring of this character was changed from (?) to (0) (MDE, 4 September 2012).';
