TEXT CHARACTER=404 TAXON=5 TEXT='The presence of cleithrum is uncertain in Youngina capensis (Smith and Evans, 1996: 296) (MDE, 3 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=404 TAXON=24 TEXT='The presence of a cleithrum is ambiguous in Protorosaurus Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009) (MDE, 3 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=404 TAXON=141 TEXT='Since none of the preserved specimens of Erythrosuchus possess an articulated pectoral girdle I consider that the presence or absence of a cleithrum cannot be determined (MDE, 24 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=405 TAXON=101 TEXT='Based on Tatarinov (1978: 511) (MDE, 25 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=406 TAXON=99 TEXT='The interclavicle of Prolacerta lacks an anterior process (BP/1/2675). Accordingly, the scoring of this character was changed from (0) to (1) (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=406 TAXON=151 TEXT='I consider that the anterior portion of the interclavicle of the holotype specimen is not enough preserved to assessed the condition of the character (MDE, 24 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=407 TAXON=49 TEXT='Based on ZAR 06 (2 May, 2014)';
TEXT CHARACTER=407 TAXON=104 TEXT='Based on GHG 363 (MDE, 12 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=409 TAXON=5 TEXT='The anterior half of the interclavicle is T-shaped, with sharp angles between lateral and posterior processes (Gow, 1975: 9c; Smith and Evans, 1996: 6c) (MDE, 3 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=409 TAXON=60 TEXT='Gregory_1945:_pl._26._(DM)';
TEXT CHARACTER=409 TAXON=73 TEXT='Although DIlkes (1998) described the interclavicle of Mesosuchus as T-shaped its anterior end is diamond-shaped (MDE, 27 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=409 TAXON=101 TEXT='Based on Tatarinov (1978: 511) (MDE, 25 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=409 TAXON=151 TEXT='I consider that the anterior portion of the interclavicle of the holotype specimen is not enough preserved to assessed the condition of the character (MDE, 24 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=410 TAXON=15 TEXT='The posterior ramus of the interclavicle is not known (Fraser and Walkden 1984) (MDE, 12 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=412 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Gow (1975: 95) (MDE, 15 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=412 TAXON=16 TEXT='Evans (1981: fig. 15) clearly shows that the clavicle articulates with the ventral surface of the interclavicle (MDE, 10 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=412 TAXON=29 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T4355 (MDE, 10 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=412 TAXON=60 TEXT='Based on Gregory (1945: 301) (MDE, 13 November 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=413 TAXON=5 TEXT='The presence of mineralized sternal plates in Youngina was confirmed by Smith and Evans (1996) (MDE, 4 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=413 TAXON=141 TEXT='Since none of the preserved specimens of Erythrosuchus possess an articulated pectoral girdle I consider that the presence or absence of a mineralized sternum cannot be determined (MDE, 24 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=413 TAXON=266 TEXT='The bones interpreted by Sereno (2012) as sternal plates are likely uncinate processes (MDE, 27 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=414 TAXON=5 TEXT='50.9 mm estimated forelimb in SAM-PK-K7710a based on BP/1/3859. 67 hindlimb of SAM-PK-K710a. Ratio= 0.76 (MDE, 22 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=414 TAXON=24 TEXT='Length of the forelimb of BSPG 1995 I 5, cast of WMsN P 47361: 203.8 mm.  Lenth of the hindlimb of BSPG 1995 I 5, cast of WMsN P 47361, based on extrapolations with NHMW 1974 1635: 318.3 mm. Ratio: 0.64 (MDE, 22 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=415 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on BPI/1/3859 (MDE, 15 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=415 TAXON=29 TEXT='The condition of the character is not clear in the available specimens due to the strong degree of compression of the materials (MDE, 10 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=416 TAXON=57 TEXT='Question mark because the holotype represents an immature individual (MDE, 7 November 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=416 TAXON=59 TEXT='State 2 was scored here because the holotype of Malerisaurus langstoni very likely repressent a juvenile condition (MDE, 06 November 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=416 TAXON=103 TEXT='ratio=0.28 (MDE, 3 Octuber 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=416 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.32 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=422 TAXON=160 TEXT='Trotteyn (2011) described that the shape of the deltopectoral crest cannot be determined because of postmortem deformation (MDE, 14 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=424 TAXON=153 TEXT='ratio < 0.38 (MDE, 09 August 2024)';
TEXT CHARACTER=424 TAXON=165 TEXT='ratio=0.31 (PVL 4604) (MDE, 19-2-2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=424 TAXON=178 TEXT='ca. 0.33 based on Foffa et al. 2020 (MDE, 13 July 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=424 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.52 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=425 TAXON=15 TEXT='In Planocephalosaurus the entepicondyle is strongly developed in comparison with the shaft width at mid-length (Fraser and Walkden 1984: fig. 14). Accordingly, the scoring of this character was changed from (0) to (1) (MDE, 14 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=425 TAXON=23 TEXT='The condition seems to be more similar to that of Youngina capensis (BP/1/3859) than to that of Prolacerta broomi (BP/1/2675) (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=425 TAXON=24 TEXT='The degree of development of the entepicondyle in Protorosaurus is more similar to Youngina than to Prolacerta (WMsN P47361) (MDE, 3 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=427 TAXON=5 TEXT='A supinator process and an ectopicondylar groove are present is Youngina (BP/1/3859). Accordingly, the scoring of this character was changed from (?) to (1) (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=427 TAXON=151 TEXT='In the holotype of Euparkeria there is no supinator ridge neither a deep groove in the distal end of the right humerus (MDE, 24 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=428 TAXON=3 TEXT='Based on MNHN 1908-32-57 (MDE, 2 June 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=428 TAXON=24 TEXT='IN BSPG 1995 I 5  there are a well-developed condyle next to the ectepicondyle and it is very likely that its degree of development is understimated due to the strong dorsoventral degree of compression that suffered the bone. The same condition or even more developed distal condyles are observed in other individuals and in BSPG AS VII 1207 there is evidence of at least three distinct distal condyles (MDE, 13 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=428 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-6536 (MDE, 11 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=430 TAXON=5 TEXT='Youngina lacks an olecranon process in the ulna (Gow 1975: fig. 9a) (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=430 TAXON=16 TEXT='Based on Evans (1981: 97) and the presence of a distinct and large posterior depression in the distal end of the humerus (MDE, 21 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=430 TAXON=60 TEXT='In Trilophosaurus buettneri the olecranon process is prominent but it is not ossified separately (Spielmann et al. 2008: figs. 69, 70). As a result, the scoring of this character was changed from (0) to (1) (MDE, 5 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=433 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-6046 (MDE, 4 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=434 TAXON=5 TEXT='The distal end is concave in BP/1/3859, but possibly because of the lack of complete ossification of the distal end (MDE, 11 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=435 TAXON=178 TEXT='0.77 based on Foffa et al. 2020 (MDE, 13 July 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=435 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.77 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=436 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Gow (1975: 97) (MDE, 15 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=436 TAXON=29 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T4355 (MDE, 10 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=436 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on Nosotti (2007: table 4, 6) (MDE, 11 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=440 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on Nosotti (2007: 30, fig. 23) (MDE, 12 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=440 TAXON=104 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-K140 (MDE, 6 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=441 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Gow (1975: 95) (MDE, 29 March 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=441 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on Nosoti (2007: fig. 23) (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=442 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on Nosoti (2007: fig. 23) (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=444 TAXON=272 TEXT='This scorings is based on the reinterpretation of the distal carpals preserved in PVSJ 373 as dc2-5 instead of dc1-4 (MDE, April 13 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=445 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on BSPG 1995 I 5 (MDE, 10 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=445 TAXON=60 TEXT='In TMM 31025-140 the lengh of manus is 16.8 cm based on Spielmann et al. (2008: fig. 74) and length of humerus is 17.0-17.6 based on Spielmann et al. (2008: appendix 10) (MDE, 13 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=445 TAXON=73 TEXT='No specimen preserves both complete humerus and manus (MDE, 11 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=446 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = <0.28 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=447 TAXON=148 TEXT='Based on Nesbitt et al. (2009: 831) (MDE, 27 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=448 TAXON=178 TEXT='0.27 based on Foffa et al. 2020 (MDE, 13 July 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=448 TAXON=254 TEXT='ratio = 0.26 (MDE, 11 July 2022)';
TEXT CHARACTER=448 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.31-0.33 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=450 TAXON=151 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-13666 (MDE, 11 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=452 TAXON=151 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-13666 (MDE, 31 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=454 TAXON=75 TEXT='Based on SHYMS 6 (MDE, 12 Septemebr 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=454 TAXON=101 TEXT='Based on Tatarinov (1978: 511) (MDE, 25 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=455 TAXON=5 TEXT='The pelvic girdle is solid in Youngina (BP/1/3859). Accordingly the scoring of this character was changed from (1) to (0) (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=455 TAXON=15 TEXT='The acetabulum is completely closed (Fraser and Walkden 1984: fig. 16) (MDE, 12 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=455 TAXON=29 TEXT='The acetabular wall appears to be partially open in PIMUZ T4822 probably because of lack of preservation (MDE, 18 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=456 TAXON=200 TEXT='Based on the orientation of the sacral rib facets and in agreement with the scoring of Nesbitt et al. (2014: character 270) (MDE, 11 November 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=458 TAXON=185 TEXT='ratio = equal or lower than 0.21 (MDE, 24 April 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=462 TAXON=199 TEXT='In PVL 3828 there is a crest cofluent with the anterior border of the preacetabular process, but it is absent in PVL 3826 (MDE, 20 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=463 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009:165) (MDE, 10 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=463 TAXON=167 TEXT='ratio = ca. 1.10 (MDE, 06 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=463 TAXON=265 TEXT='ratio = 0.93 (MDE, 08 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=463 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 1.08 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=464 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009: 165) (MDE, 26 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=465 TAXON=199 TEXT='The depression on the ventral surface of the base of the postacetabular process in PVL 3827 does not reach the distal end of the process, contrasting with the condition in dinosauriforms (MDE, 20 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=466 TAXON=264 TEXT='Based on ZPAL Ab III 364 (MDE, April 23 2015)';
TEXT CHARACTER=471 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Smith and Evans (1996: 297) (MDE, 3 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=471 TAXON=24 TEXT='In the Simon/Bartholomaeus specimen the thyroid fenestra is absent (SMNS cast, MDE pers. obs.) (MDE, 9 August 2013)';
TEXT CHARACTER=471 TAXON=60 TEXT='Based on Gregory (1945: fig. 9) (MDE, 25 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=471 TAXON=72 TEXT='Based on Carroll (1976: 47) (MDE, 10 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=472 TAXON=49 TEXT='Pubis and ischium fused to each other (MDE, April 24 2020)';
TEXT CHARACTER=472 TAXON=71 TEXT='ca. 0.38 (MDE, 3 September 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=472 TAXON=185 TEXT='ratio = < 0.34 (MDE, 24 April 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=473 TAXON=190 TEXT='Based on NHMUK R2410 and Walker 1964: fig. 11g (MDE, 20 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=473 TAXON=199 TEXT='The pubis has a groove in PVL 3827 (MDE, 20 August 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=474 TAXON=1 TEXT='Based on Reisz (1981: 42): a second, smaller process extends ventrolaterally from the ridge connecting the lateral pubic tubercle to the acetabulum. This process ... probably served as the origin of the ambiens and pubotibialis muscles (MDE, 12 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=477 TAXON=75 TEXT='Based on BATGM M20a, b (MDE, 30 October 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=478 TAXON=167 TEXT='ratio = ca. 1.28 or slightly lower (MDE, 06 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=478 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.30 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=479 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Smith and Evans (1996: 297) (MDE, 3 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=484 TAXON=211 TEXT='Based on Nesbitt (2005: 37) (MDE, 23 December 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=485 TAXON=264 TEXT='Based on Nesbitt (2011: 140) (MDE, 24 April 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=488 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on Simon and Bartholomaeus specimen (MDE, 31 March 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=489 TAXON=153 TEXT='ratio = ca. 1.72 (Sues et al., 2024: 13) (MDE, 9 August 2024)';
TEXT CHARACTER=489 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 1.91 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=490 TAXON=24 TEXT='The humeri and femora are strongly compressed and the diameter of the bones cannot be measured (MDE, 3 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=490 TAXON=153 TEXT='ratio = ca. 1.61 (MDE, 9 August 2024)';
TEXT CHARACTER=490 TAXON=165 TEXT='ratio=1.25 (PVL 4604) (MDE, 19-2-2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=490 TAXON=167 TEXT='ratio = ca. 0.9 (MDE, 06 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=490 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 1.54 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=491 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on BSPG AS VII 1207 (MDE, 13 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=491 TAXON=57 TEXT='Question mark because the holotype represents a juvenile individual (MDE, 7 November 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=508 TAXON=5 TEXT='BP/1/3859 was prepared with acid and, as a result, the thickness of the bone wall may look artificially thinner (MDE, 11 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=508 TAXON=200 TEXT='Based on Nesbitt et al. (2014: character 323) (MDE, 11 November 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=508 TAXON=278 TEXT='ratio = 0.18 based on PVSJ 745 (MDE, 23 December 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=508 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.24 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=509 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on SMNS 55387 cast of Simon and Bartholomeus specimen (MDE, 13 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=509 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on the femur of SAM-PK-7416 (MDE, 11 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=510 TAXON=51 TEXT='ratio = 0.25 (MDE, 30 October 2020)';
TEXT CHARACTER=510 TAXON=57 TEXT='Question mark because the holotype represents a juvenile individual (MDE, 7 November 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=510 TAXON=153 TEXT='ratio = ca. 0.26 (MDE, 9 August 2024)';
TEXT CHARACTER=510 TAXON=167 TEXT='ratio = ca. 0.15 (MDE, 06 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=510 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.15-0.18 (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=511 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on SMNS 55387 cast of Simon Bartholomaeus specimen (MDE, 12 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=511 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on SMNS 54626 (MDE, 12 March 2014).';
