TEXT CHARACTER=523 TAXON=200 TEXT='Probably miscored by Nesbitt et al. (2014: character 337) (MDE, 11 November 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=529 TAXON=200 TEXT='Although scored as a low crest-shaped structure by Nesbitt et al. (2014: character 339), the tubercle is considerably better developed than in non-pseudosuchian archosauromorphs (MDE, 11 November 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=532 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009: 172) (MDE, 3 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=533 TAXON=5 TEXT='It seems that it was present in adult specimens (Broom, 1921; Smith and Evans, 1996: fig. 8d) (MDE, 3 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=533 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on Wild (1974: 116) and Nosotti (2007: 35) (MDE, 11 October 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=535 TAXON=75 TEXT='The better preserved proximal tarsals are preserved in posterior view (MDE, April 8 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=536 TAXON=154 TEXT='Inferred from tibial morphology (MDE, April 14 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=536 TAXON=200 TEXT='The condition of this character is extremely similar to that of Smilosuchus and Parasuchus (MDE, 10 November 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=536 TAXON=227 TEXT='Inferred from the morphology of the distal end of tibia (MDE, 9 October 2014)';
TEXT CHARACTER=536 TAXON=252 TEXT='The supposed second basin on the astragalus, if present, is placed posterolateral rather than posteromedial (PVL 3871), contrasting with Riojasuchus, suchians and Lagerpetidae (MDE, 20 October 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=537 TAXON=154 TEXT='Inferred from tibial morphology (MDE, April 14 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=537 TAXON=159 TEXT='Inferred from tibial morphology (MDE, April 14 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=539 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009: fig. 25c) (MDE, 13 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=539 TAXON=142 TEXT='The identification of the posterior groove by Gower (1996) was tentative (MDE, 27 March 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=541 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on SAM-PK-7416 (MDE, 23 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=541 TAXON=151 TEXT='Nesbitt (2011) scored Euparkeria as (1), but the posterior portion of the dorsolateral margin of the astragalus overlaps the calcaneum to the same extent as the anterior portion (UMCZ T692) (MDE, 25 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=542 TAXON=16 TEXT='The astragalus possesses a deep, ventrally opened notch in anterior or posterior view to receive the distal tarsal 4 (see Evans, 1981: fig. 27a, b) (MDE, 17 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=542 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on Nosotti (2007: 72) (MDE, 13 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=545 TAXON=60 TEXT='Gregory (1945: 316) described the absence of a strong "tuber calcis" in Trilophosaurus (MDE, 24 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=545 TAXON=72 TEXT='Based on Carroll (1976: 48) (MDE, 18 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=545 TAXON=73 TEXT='Although a calcaneal tuber was scored as absent in Mesosuchus by Dilkes (1998: character 119) it can be observed in the right hindlimb of SAM-PK-7416 (MDE, 27 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=545 TAXON=290 TEXT='The calcaneal tuber of Eodromaeus is incipient (MDE, 24 December 2021)';
TEXT CHARACTER=556 TAXON=72 TEXT='The reconstruction of the ankle of Noteosuchus by Carroll (1976) looks rather weird (MDE, 17 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=556 TAXON=290 TEXT='ratio = 0.25 (MDE, 08 November 2019)';
TEXT CHARACTER=557 TAXON=24 TEXT='Based on SMNS 55387, cast of the Simon Bartholomaeus specimen, and Gottman-Quesada and Sanger (2009: figs. 25) (MDE, 10 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=557 TAXON=29 TEXT='Based on Rieppel (1989: 380) (MDE, 18 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=557 TAXON=72 TEXT='I consider that cannot be confidently assessed that the central did not contact the tibia (MDE, 18 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=563 TAXON=5 TEXT='Based on Broom (1921) (Smith and Evans: 1996: fig. 8d) (MDE, 3 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=563 TAXON=24 TEXT='It would be possible that the distal tarsal 5 is fused to the distal tarsal 4 (Gottman-Quesada and Sander (2009: 172) (MDE, 3 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=563 TAXON=72 TEXT='Based on Carroll (1976: 48) (MDE, 18 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=564 TAXON=1 TEXT='Based on Peabody (1952: fig. 6a) (MDE, 12 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=564 TAXON=5 TEXT='The metatarsal IV + digit 4 are considerably longer than the tibia (Smith and Evans, 1996: table 1) (MDE, 4 September 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=564 TAXON=29 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T4822 (MDE, 18 February 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=564 TAXON=38 TEXT='Based on PIMUZ T2817 (MDE, 2 September 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=564 TAXON=73 TEXT='The distal phalanges of the fourth pedal digit are not preserved (MDE, 27 August 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=564 TAXON=75 TEXT='Based on SHYMS 5 (MDE, 12 September 2014).';
TEXT CHARACTER=564 TAXON=104 TEXT='The complete length of the fourth digit is not known in Proterosuchus specimens (MDE, 20 June 2012).';
TEXT CHARACTER=566 TAXON=5 TEXT='The metatarsals overlap proximally with each other (BP/1/3859). Accordingly the scoring of this character was changed from (?) to (1) (MDE, 11 August 2013).';
TEXT CHARACTER=566 TAXON=72 TEXT='Based on Carroll (1976: 48) (MDE, 18 September 2012).';
