TEXT CHARACTER=634 TAXON=79 TEXT='The best preserved skull has a rather deformed temporal region (MDE, 27 December 2015).';
TEXT CHARACTER=640 TAXON=73 TEXT='Based on Evans (1986: fig. 8) (MDE, July 31 2016).';
TEXT CHARACTER=672 TAXON=290 TEXT='Based on PVSJ 560 because PVSJ 562 seems to be deformed (MDE, 07 November 2019)';
